## 為電子商務網站打造前端界面的完整流程

下面的指南把整個前端開發流程拆成幾個可操作的階段，從需求分析到最終部署。你可以根據自己的技術棧、團隊規模和產品定位選擇合適的工具與方法。

| 階段 | 目標 | 主要任務 | 推薦工具 / 技術 |
|------|------|----------|-----------------|
| 1. 需求 & 規劃 | 明確功能、用戶流程、設計風格 | - 用戶故事、功能清單<br>- 競品分析<br>- 風格指南（色彩、字體、圖標） | Trello / Jira / Notion<br>Figma / Sketch / Adobe XD |
| 2. 原型設計 | 視覺化交互流程 | - 低保真原型<br>- 高保真設計稿<br>- 交互動畫 | Figma（原生原型功能）<br>Framer |
| 3. 技術選型 | 確定框架、庫、構建工具 | - 前端框架（React/Vue/Angular）<br>- CSS 框架（Tailwind/Bootstrap）<br>- 狀態管理（Redux/Vuex）<br>- API 通訊（Axios/Fetch） | React + Vite + Tailwind + Redux Toolkit |
| 4. 開發環境搭建 | 快速啟動、代碼規範 | - Vite / Create‑React‑App / Vue CLI<br>- ESLint + Prettier<br>- TypeScript | Vite + React + TypeScript |
| 5. UI 組件化 | 可重用、易維護 | - 建立共用組件庫（Button、Card、Modal 等）<br>- 使用 Storybook 進行組件文檔 | Storybook |
| 6. 路由 & 佈局 | 多頁面導航、佈局一致 | - React Router / Vue Router<br>- Layout 系統（Header、Footer、Sidebar） | React Router |
| 7. 資料流 & API | 與後端交互、狀態同步 | - Axios / Fetch<br>- Redux Toolkit Query / React Query<br>- WebSocket（實時更新） | Redux Toolkit Query |
| 8. 電子商務核心功能 | 商品展示、購物車、結帳 | - 商品列表、篩選、排序<br>- 購物車（本地存儲、同步）<br>- 結帳流程（支付集成） | Stripe / PayPal SDK |
| 9. 響應式 & 無障礙 | 兼容多設備、符合 WCAG | - CSS Flex/Grid + Tailwind<br>- ARIA 標籤、語義化 HTML | Tailwind + aXe |
| 10. 性能優化 | 加載速度、渲染效率 | - Code Splitting、懶加載<br>- 圖片優化（WebP、懶加載）<br>- CDN、HTTP/2 | Vite 的 Tree Shaking、Image CDN |
| 11. 測試 | 保證品質 | - 單元測試（Jest + React Testing Library）<br>- 集成測試<br>- E2E 測試（Cypress） | Jest + Cypress |
| 12. CI/CD | 自動化部署 | - GitHub Actions / GitLab CI<br>- Docker、Vercel / Netlify | GitHub Actions + Vercel |
| 13. SEO & Analytics | 搜索引擎友好、數據追蹤 | - SSR / SSG（Next.js / Nuxt.js）<br>- Meta Tags、Open Graph<br>- Google Analytics / Mixpanel | Next.js + Headless CMS |

---

## 具體實作示例（React + Vite + Tailwind）

### 1. 初始化專案

```bash
npm create vite@latest ecommerce-frontend -- --template react-ts
cd ecommerce-frontend
npm i
```

### 2. 安裝依賴

```bash
npm i tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
npm i axios react-router-dom @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux
npm i -D eslint prettier eslint-plugin-react eslint-config-prettier eslint-plugin-prettier
```

### 3. 配置 Tailwind

`tailwind.config.js`

```js
module.exports = {
  content: [
    "./index.html",
    "./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}",
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

`src/index.css`

```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
```

### 4. 建立基本路由

`src/App.tsx`

```tsx
import { BrowserRouter as Router, Routes, Route } from 'react-router-dom';
import Home from './pages/Home';
import ProductDetail from './pages/ProductDetail';
import Cart from './pages/Cart';
import Checkout from './pages/Checkout';

export default function App() {
  return (
    <Router>
      <Routes>
        <Route path="/" element={<Home />} />
        <Route path="/product/:id" element={<ProductDetail />} />
        <Route path="/cart" element={<Cart />} />
        <Route path="/checkout" element={<Checkout />} />
      </Routes>
    </Router>
  );
}
```

### 5. Redux Toolkit 設定

`src/store.ts`

```ts
import { configureStore } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';
import cartReducer from './slices/cartSlice';
import productsReducer from './slices/productsSlice';

export const store = configureStore({
  reducer: {
    cart: cartReducer,
    products: productsReducer,
  },
});

export type RootState = ReturnType<typeof store.getState>;
export type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch;
```

`src/slices/cartSlice.ts`

```ts
import { createSlice, PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';

interface CartItem {
  productId: string;
  quantity: number;
}

interface CartState {
  items: CartItem[];
}

const initialState: CartState = { items: [] };

const cartSlice = createSlice({
  name: 'cart',
  initialState,
  reducers: {
    addToCart(state, action: PayloadAction<CartItem>) {
      const existing = state.items.find(i => i.productId === action.payload.productId);
      if (existing) {
        existing.quantity += action.payload.quantity;
      } else {
        state.items.push(action.payload);
      }
    },
    removeFromCart(state, action: PayloadAction<string>) {
      state.items = state.items.filter(i => i.productId !== action.payload);
    },
    clearCart(state) {
      state.items = [];
    },
  },
});

export const { addToCart, removeFromCart, clearCart } = cartSlice.actions;
export default cartSlice.reducer;
```

### 6. 商品列表頁（簡化版）

`src/pages/Home.tsx`

```tsx
import { useEffect } from 'react';
import { useDispatch, useSelector } from 'react-redux';
import { fetchProducts } from '../slices/productsSlice';
import { RootState } from '../store';
import { Link } from 'react-router-dom';

export default function Home() {
  const dispatch = useDispatch();
  const { items, loading } = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.products);

  useEffect(() => {
    dispatch(fetchProducts());
  }, [dispatch]);

  if (loading) return <p>Loading...</p>;

  return (
    <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 p-4">
      {items.map(product => (
        <Link key={product.id} to={`/product/${product.id}`} className="border rounded p-2 hover:shadow-lg">
          <img src={product.image} alt={product.title} className="w-full h-48 object-cover" />
          <h3 className="mt-2 font-semibold">{product.title}</h3>
          <p className="text-green-600">${product.price}</p>
        </Link>
      ))}
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 7. 購物車頁面

`src/pages/Cart.tsx`

```tsx
import { useSelector, useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { RootState } from '../store';
import { removeFromCart, clearCart } from '../slices/cartSlice';
import { Link } from 'react-router-dom';

export default function Cart() {
  const dispatch = useDispatch();
  const items = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.cart.items);
  const products = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.products.items);

  const cartDetails = items.map(item => {
    const product = products.find(p => p.id === item.productId);
    return { ...product, quantity: item.quantity };
  });

  const total = cartDetails.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.quantity, 0);

  return (
    <div className="p-4">
      <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Shopping Cart</h2>
      {cartDetails.length === 0 ? (
        <p>Your cart is empty.</p>
      ) : (
        <>
          <ul className="space-y-4">
            {cartDetails.map(item => (
              <li key={item.id} className="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-2">
                <div>
                  <h3 className="font-semibold">{item.title}</h3>
                  <p>{item.quantity} × ${item.price}</p>
                </div>
                <button
                  onClick={() => dispatch(removeFromCart(item.id))}
                  className="text-red-600"
                >
                  Remove
                </button>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <div className="mt-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <span className="font-semibold text-xl">Total: ${total.toFixed(2)}</span>
            <Link to="/checkout" className="bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded">
              Proceed to Checkout
            </Link>
          </div>
        </>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 8. 結帳頁面（簡化版）

`src/pages/Checkout.tsx`

```tsx
import { useSelector, useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { RootState } from '../store';
import { clearCart } from '../slices/cartSlice';
import { useState } from 'react';

export default function Checkout() {
  const dispatch = useDispatch();
  const cartItems = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.cart.items);
  const products = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.products.items);
  const [paymentSuccess, setPaymentSuccess] = useState(false);

  const total = cartItems.reduce((sum, item) => {
    const product = products.find(p => p.id === item.productId);
    return sum + (product?.price ?? 0) * item.quantity;
  }, 0);

  const handlePayment = async () => {
    // 這裡你可以調用 Stripe / PayPal SDK
    // 假設支付成功
    setPaymentSuccess(true);
    dispatch(clearCart());
  };

  if (paymentSuccess) {
    return <p>Thank you for your purchase! Your order has been placed.</p>;
  }

  return (
    <div className="p-4">
      <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Checkout</h2>
      <p>Total: ${total.toFixed(2)}</p>
      <button
        onClick={handlePayment}
        className="mt-4 bg-green-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded"
      >
        Pay Now
      </button>
    </div>
  );
}
```

